      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GAMBLER (5) is the one to beat after putting together consecutive Sunshine Coast wins, the latest as an odds-on favourite when scoring from HEART AND SPIRIT. He boasts a strong record around 1000m and keeps Marshall aboard who's two from two on him. No reason he can't bring up the hat-trick. THE FIXER (4) has struggled in his last two but should find this a bit easier and will get a tempo to suit. Thompson taking over is another good push. HEART AND SPIRIT (8) led the GAMBLER at big odds when resuming, only to be claimed late. Now meets him 2.5kgs better and can turn the tables. YOWERI (7) is hard to fault and finds another suitable contest. Gets in light with Youngberry's 2kg claim and only needs to hold his form to be right there again.",
